  "ruleText": "Sw 704.01 Eligibility. In order to be considered eligible, a sales rep shall have completed his or her probationary period prior to the beginning of the quarter.\n\nSource. #10035, INTERIM, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRES: 6-29-12; ss by #10132, eff 5-23-12",
